{"2541530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AETHUS", "steam_appid": 2541530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4235910, 4235920], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/c5b09e9e6abd07ecec3a21c5e8e95cf9.avif?t=1786695005\" width=1368 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/db8692ed1aa2dcda700aebc103b765c2.poster.avif?t=1786695005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/db8692ed1aa2dcda700aebc103b765c2.webm?t=1786695005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/db8692ed1aa2dcda700aebc103b765c2.mp4?t=1786695005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About AETHUS</strong>®</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Maeve</strong>, ex-mining engineer for the <strong><i>Astral Resource Corporation</i></strong> - <strong>ARC</strong> - a galactic megacorp that profits by <strong>draining entire planets of their resources</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you take on your own mining claim</strong>, you'll explore the remnants of <strong>a doomed science expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong> as Maeve strives to build a stable life of her own, <strong>outside of ARC’s control</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but her <strong>basic mining equipment</strong>, tales from her <strong>beloved grandad</strong>, and <strong>her loyal AI drone companion</strong>, can you unravel the mystery of an <strong>incredibly powerful new element </strong>and uncover the <strong>dark secrets</strong> that <strong>the corpos would rather keep buried?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/42cdad07f08eb62dd2645512d389df13.webp?t=1786695005\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.poster.avif?t=1786695005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.webm?t=1786695005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.mp4?t=1786695005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/82a500f16cd205843fd10b6a25c91331.avif?t=1786695005\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Use the <strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own <strong>mining operations hub</strong> filled with <strong>dozens of types of refining, processing and crafting stations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow plants, raise fish and prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/84e5e3ae9b58dad954c8c47dde0105f0.webp?t=1786695005\" width=610 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/603a0b470b727f21ca64700cde096673.avif?t=1786695005\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.poster.avif?t=1786695005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.webm?t=1786695005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.mp4?t=1786695005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/26b0056572eb4d3a6974014fa920c95b.avif?t=1786695005\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of different resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your suit and mining drone companion</strong> to explore deeper and further into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/30e36b90e1752fc56b738cb32e5fe5f4.avif?t=1786695005\" width=610 heig